"Plug in a charger to read its handshake. USB-PD adapters advertise a menu of voltage/current profiles; the phone picks one and this page shows which, alongside what is actually flowing." = "接入充电器后可读取握手信息。USB-PD 适配器会广播一组电压／电流档位，手机从中挑选一档，本页显示选中的是哪一档，以及实际流动的功率。";
