"Wireless charging has no input-current sensor, so there is nothing to compare against the rating. The voltage and current below are the profile the pad negotiated — a ceiling that stays put while the actual draw moves." = "无线充电没有输入电流传感器，因此没有可与额定值比较的对象。下面的电压与电流是充电板协商出的档位 —— 一个固定不动的上限，实际取用则在它之下浮动。";
"Well under the adapter's rating while the system is thermally throttling — the ceiling right now is heat, not the charger." = "系统正在温控降频，所以远低于适配器额定值 —— 此刻的限制来自发热，不是充电器。";
"Charging is on hold, so almost nothing is being drawn. Optimized Battery Charging or a charge limit looks exactly like this." = "充电处于暂停状态，几乎没有取用。优化电池充电或充电上限就是这个样子。";
"Above 80% the charger tapers to constant-voltage, so low draw here is normal battery chemistry, not a weak charger." = "超过 80% 后充电器转入恒压涓流，此时取用低是正常的电池特性，不是充电器不行。";
"Wireless charging is capped well below what the adapter could deliver over the cable." = "无线充电的上限本就远低于该适配器走线缆时能给出的功率。";
"The voltage at the port has collapsed well below what was negotiated, and the phone is holding the current down to keep it up. That is the cable or the plugs, not the charger." = "端口电压已远低于协商值，手机正压着电流不让它继续跌。问题在线缆或插头，不在充电器。";
"Drawing well under the adapter's rating. A thin cable, a shared port, or a profile the phone declined can all do this." = "实际取用远低于适配器额定值。细线缆、共用的端口、或者手机拒绝了某个档位，都会是这样。";
